            { text: "therefore {DB|BD} is commensurable in length with {BC},",
              visible: SQ,
              highlighted: ["BD","BC"] },
            { text: "so that {DA|ADh} is commensurable with {AC|ACh}.",
              visible: SQ,
              highlighted: ["ADh","ACh"],
              justifications: [
                  { claim: "DB : BC = DA : AC", ref: "VI.1" },
                  { claim: "DA, AC commensurable", ref: "X.11" } ] },
            { text: "But {DA|ADh} is medial, therefore {AC|ACh} is also medial.",
              visible: SQ,
              highlighted: ["ADh","ACh"],
              justifications: [{ claim: "commensurable with a medial area", ref: "X.23.Cor" }] },
            { text: "Therefore, the rectangle contained by medial straight lines commensurable in length is medial.",
